# Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/
# NOTE: Package.resolved is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the PIN for this
# app's Swift Package dependencies (WhisperKit): an exact version in the project
# file still resolves through a git TAG, and a tag can be moved. Committing the
# resolved revision is what makes a clone build the bytes this machine built.
# (Same rule the model catalogue follows: pin the commit, not the name.)

